sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    Actor AppPublisher
    Actor NetworkOperator
    Actor ClusterOperator
    Actor VNode operator
    participant RPC_WORKER 
    participant FLOW_WORKER
    participant FLOW_SANDBOX
    participant DB_WORKER
    note over AppPublisher, NetworkOperator: DF_SEND_CPB1 

    AppPublisher ->>+ NetworkOperator: <<DF_SEND_CPB1>><br/>Send CPB()
    NetworkOperator ->>+ ClusterOperator: Send CPI() 
    note over AppPublisher, ClusterOperator: out of band
    note over ClusterOperator, RPC_WORKER: DF_UPLOAD_CPI
    ClusterOperator-)+RPC_WORKER: Upload CPI()DF_UPLOAD_CPI
    alt VNode API flow call

    VNode operator->>+RPC_WORKER: Flow (classname, request data {...})
    RPC_WORKER--)FLOW_WORKER: execureFlow()
    FLOW_WORKER->>+FLOW_SANDBOX: Create new SandBox()
    note over FLOW_WORKER, FLOW_SANDBOX: injects services

    FLOW_WORKER->>+FLOW_SANDBOX: call(requestBody: RPCRequestData)
    FLOW_SANDBOX->>+FLOW_SANDBOX: @InitiatingFlow flow call(request data{...})
    FLOW_SANDBOX->>+FLOW_WORKER: call CordaInject service()
    FLOW_WORKER->>+FLOW_SANDBOX: ret
    FLOW_SANDBOX--)FLOW_SANDBOX2: sendMessage(request data taint{...})
    note over FLOW_SANDBOX2, FLOW_SANDBOX: receives another message (out of rder)

    FLOW_WORKER->>FLOW_SANDBOX: suspend()
    FLOW_WORKER->>DB_WORKER: persistFlow()
    end
    alt Flow receives message
    FLOW_SANDBOX2--)FLOW_WORKER: sendMessage(request data taint{...})
    note over FLOW_SANDBOX2,FLOW_WORKER:  simplified call (e2e session and other details are not in scope) 
    FLOW_WORKER--)DB_WORKER: Load Flow Code from DB()
    FLOW_WORKER->>+FLOW_SANDBOX: Create SandBox from suspended flow()
    FLOW_SANDBOX->>+FLOW_SANDBOX: execute Flow @InitiatedBy...()
                                
    end
